title Klondike: a game by deal number, typed into the toolkit's field (the on-screen keyboard shows where no keyboard is)
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1280x800 480x800 800x1280 480x640
env KLONDIKE_TEST_DATA n-number
env KLONDIKE_TEST_RESET 1
env KLONDIKE_TEST_DEAL 1
wait 300
key m
wait 200
key down
key enter
wait 300
expect osk on
shot dialog
check dialog
type "4242"
wait 100
shot typed
key enter
wait 500
expect osk off
expect text "Deal 4242"
shot dealt
check dealt
